  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Cut cauliflower into small florets. Cut red onion into thick wedges. Cut carrot into bite-sized chunks.\n• Cut beetroot into small chunks.\n• Place prepped veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with chermoula spice blend and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 25-30 minutes.\n• TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the veggies between two trays.\n• TIP: Beetroot stays firm when cooked. It’s done when you can pierce it with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4fa02f6e4158183d5d929d/step-96fab600.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4fa02f6e4158183d5d929d/step-b1e80810.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Toast pearl couscous, stirring occasionally, until golden, 1-2 minutes.\n• Carefully half-fill the saucepan with water, then add a pinch of salt.\n• Simmer, uncovered, until tender, 14-16 minutes.\n• Drain, rinse and return to the pan with a drizzle of olive oil, then stir through stock concentrate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4fa02f6e4158183d5d929d/step-232db120.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the roast veggies have 10 minutes remaining, heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• When oil is hot, cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Reduce heat to medium, then add the honey. Turn haloumi to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4fa02f6e4158183d5d929d/step-3147eb30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "To the couscous, stir through roasted veggies until combined.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4fa02f6e4158183d5d929d/step-a0e0b240.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide pearl couscous between bowls.\n• Drizzle with golden goddess dressing.\n• Top with honey-glazed haloumi.\n• Serve with a dollop of garlic sauce and sprinkle with flaked almonds. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4fa02f6e4158183d5d929d/step-3a208d50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
